sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant CSV as CSV file
    participant Producer as Python producer
    participant Kafka as Kafka broker/topic
    participant Spark as Spark Structured Streaming
    participant MySQL as MySQL
    Producer->>CSV: Read each row
    CSV-->>Producer: Synthetic row by default
    Producer->>Kafka: Publish JSON to topic
    Kafka-->>Spark: Event from earliest offset
    Spark->>Spark: Parse schema; filter required values
    Spark->>Spark: Aggregate by zone in micro-batch
    Spark->>MySQL: Upsert batch and zone summary
    opt Observation history migration exists
        Spark->>Spark: Group by zone, date, and source
        Spark->>MySQL: Upsert zone/date history
    end
    MySQL-->>Spark: Commit or error
    Note over Producer,Spark: A CSV replay is not a live satellite or sensor feed.
    Note over MySQL: A stored batch does not prove the processes are currently running.
